bst}_S\\)</span> 及其全延拓 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta\">\\(\\widehat\\theta\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d1b845cf0812591a\" href=\"?note=d1b845cf0812591a\" title=\"57-df-substitution\">57-df-substitution</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nx\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq\\widehat\\theta(x),\\qquad c\\theta\\coloneqq c,\\\\\nf(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq f(t_1\\theta,\\ldots,t_n\\theta),\\\\\n(t_1\\doteq t_2)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq(t_1\\theta\\doteq t_2\\theta),\\\\\nR(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq R(t_1\\theta,\\ldots,t_n\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Subst}_A(\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq A\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nx\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq\\widehat\\theta(x),\\qquad c\\theta\\coloneqq c,\\\\\nf(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq f(t_1\\theta,\\ldots,t_n\\theta),\\\\\n(t_1\\doteq t_2)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq(t_1\\theta\\doteq t_2\\theta),\\\\\nR(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq R(t_1\\theta,\\ldots,t_n\\theta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Subst}_A(\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq A\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补足等式原子式和代换定义域外变量的分支；Subst_A 不再作为无来源的符号参与循环定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","